Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,\Nduelists of all ages,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,DiverCorp is proud to present the\NKC Grand Championship Tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We've assembled an\Noutstanding lineup of first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-class duelists from around\Nthe world just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One of which will be proud World Champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.95,0:01:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we know who that's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, can you believe this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Joey's trying to scare the\Ncompetition with his weird chicken dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some female friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace and love, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Try acting normal, just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, make some noise for\Nour Master of Ceremonies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, do they always\Nhave to be so dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you people ready\Nto get your duel on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, are you people ready\Nto see some dueling or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.09,0:02:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,because this time can kick off the greatest\Nduel monsters tournament ever organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And before the week is through,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,we may have a new International\NDuel Monsters Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So give it up for the current title\Nholder, Yugi Moto! Yugi! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give a shout out to your fans, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, maybe later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.47,0:03:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, direct your\Nattention to the Kaimotron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's time to kick off our all-star\Ntournament with the first round matchup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with Block A, the first\Ncompetitor to strap on a duelist will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler! Ah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to say to my adoring\Nfans, this one's for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be facing off against\Nour mystery duelist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A man whose true identity\Nremains unknown, Epnard Odom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal, I don't know who you are, but\Nwhen I win, that mask is coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we know him from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.91,0:03:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now moving on to Block B.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:04:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Up and cover! Leon Wilson faces\Nthe good doctor, Richard Dunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, Leon's in the first duel, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leon, you go, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But before the duels get underway,\Nthere's someone we all want to hear from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's try this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come on up here and say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let your fans down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Yugi! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant come up on stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no one said there'd\Nbe public speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm gonna make this brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate test of survival,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and it will push everyone\Ninvolved to their limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you came for a friendly game,\Nthen I'd suggest you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a ruthless battle, and in the end,\Nonly one duelist will remain standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if everyone's clear, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,From this moment forward,\NKaiba Land is a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So trust no one, and may\Nthe best duelist win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaival! Kaival! Kaival! Kaival! Kaival!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That show-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just lucky he's not dueling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know one of these pumps is out to ruin\Nme, and before this tournament's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists and Spectators, let the first\Nround of the KC Grand Championship begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All tournament matches will be\Nheld on Kaiba Island grounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but only the two remaining\Nfinalists will be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,invited back to duel right\Nhere in the Kaival Dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Match 1 will take place on\Nour Amazon Adventure Trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And Match 2 will be held\Nbeneath the Dragon's Lair Flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, competitors, please report\Nto your designated locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you should have eaten your apple\Ntoday, because this doctor is here to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,These cards are unsanitary, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw five cards and\Ncall me in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a doctor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't hurt a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This dude in the mask looks so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that our gym teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, is that... Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this young whippersnapper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where is Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a two-for-one\Nsale on weenies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be on the\NAmazon Adventure Trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey doesn't duel on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta bulk up for my\Nfirst match. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your first match has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't get your butt over to\Nthat dueling site in the next ten minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.47,0:08:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes is a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Amazon Adventure is a\N15-square-mile virtual jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to... Wait! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What a spaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.51,0:09:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this map, we\Nshould duck the boat right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, the quickness\Nroute seems to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Land ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This jungle is loaded with...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.65,0:09:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pitfalls!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is the pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Crocs! Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what? Bring left!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on their lap, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, that's probably\Ngonna leave a mark. Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time you guys want\Nto jump in and help?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we tell them\Nthey're only holograms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And spoil the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How much time do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not here in 10\Nseconds, you're disqualified!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Six, five, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With five seconds to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how'd you get here before I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a secret passageway\Nfor special guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought off giant snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,at least you made it on time joey wheeler\Nit looks like the student is finally going
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to face his former dual instructor i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time to teach you\Na lesson kid i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,think so mystery man now let's rock and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,roll listen guys we know that voice we do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,i was a dual monster's master while you\Nwere still running around in a dirty diaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,sonny boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me, shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, that mystery duelist\Nsounds just like your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but why the disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you knew about this all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to talk him out of\Nit, but he wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Arthur, I'm joining the\Ntournament and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get back in the\Naction and relive my glory days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was quite the card\Nshark in my younger years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll need a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone going easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he actually had us fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it is a pretty lame disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks to me like\NJoey is still clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what else is new?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We should probably tell\NJoey to go easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's a bit rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps is going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you invited him,\Nright? Nope. Actually, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto begged to be let in. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But he taught Yugi everything he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope he doesn't hurt himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more worried about Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be unmasked, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm showing no mercy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll start with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my Swordsman of\NLandstar in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place these two cards\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I also place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll call my wandering mummy\Nto the field in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like them appers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, that saying went\Nout about 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And while we're at it,\Nso did those overalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll attack your mummy\Nwith my swordsman of Landstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Joey, your monster\Nis weaker than his, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Graceful Dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my monster's attack points will\Nincrease depending on the number I roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a hunch you might try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I play\Nthis legendary gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card automatically activates\Nwhenever my opponent rolls a die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I roll a higher number than\Nyou, your card is canceled out. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey always has a backup lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Skulldice will lower your monster's\Nstrength depending on what I roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary gambler is a continuous\Ntrap guard, which means I also roll again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:14:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it and weep. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're back where we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Wandering Mummy, attack his swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than you know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, mystery meathead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got lucky, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll switch my little wing guard\Nto defense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, short stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's getting schooled by his teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-aggression area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, in order to activate it, I\Nneed to discard one card from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I've rendered you unable to\Nsummon any monsters in your next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it gets worse, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:15:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Mirage of Nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me continue to draw until\NI'm holding four cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before your keister\Nis removed from this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can survive the wrath of Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So consider yourself\Nwarned, Whippersnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.49,0:16:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this isn't a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I should remind you that\Nmy magic card activates now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me draw three cards,\Ngiving me a total of four in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how your magic card works, Zapnog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It also means you have to throw\Nout three cards next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal emergency provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to send one magic or trap
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,card on my side of the\Nfield to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I gain 1,000 extra\Nlife points for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I oughta...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course the card I'm removing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirage of Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only do I get to keep my hand,\Nbut I get some bonus points to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you want to play rough, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, wait till you see what I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.81,0:17:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How quickly we forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card is still in effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm afraid you can't summon\Na monster, my adolescent friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to remind\Nme how to play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently I do, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play a magic card\Nknown as Ancient City.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as the card's name\Nsuggests, it's an ancient city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just the beginning\Nof my archaeological
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Assault. Next I sacrifice wandering mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to summon my ancient giant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it comes with a slight\Ncatch As long as it remains face up on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the field I have no choice but to attack\Nyou with it And if I don't attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,then I lose 300 of my life points
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey doesn't stand a\Nchance against that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate a magic\Ncard known as Ancient Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This key lets me unlock the\Npower of my stone giant tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And they come with a twist also.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I leave them both\Nface up and don't attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,then 1,000 of my life\Npoints get taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, ancient giant, attack\Nhis little wing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, my stone giants will\Nattack your life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be happy to know that I'm\Ndone for now, so I'll place one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,face down and end my turn not too\Nshabby huh one more direct attack
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and your life points go down to\Nzilch I'd suggest you come up with
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,a strategy pretty quickly or I'm\Nafraid your tournament days are
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for an old pro like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With no monsters to\Nprotect you from my giants,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:20:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't make it past the next turn!
